SoundCraft Protocol 001 "The SoundCraft Audio Stamp Placemewnt Protocol" (A.K.A. 3.14 Protocol)

**Purpose:**
The purpose of this protocol is to state the location of 'SoundCraft Audio Stamp' [/SoundCraft Audio Stamp.m4a] in SoundCraft compositions.

I. Core Principle
The seven second 'SoundCraft Audio Stamp'[/SoundCraft Audio Stamp.m4a] is to be placed at the end of SoundCraft works, where the end of the stamp is 0 minutes and 3.14 seconds from the end of the track.

Stamp_End = Track_Length - 3.14s
Stamp_Start = Stamp_End - Stamp_Duration %%Stamp_Duration = 7 seconds%%

